digraph account_payable_process_65 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_HF8S" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_HF8S"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_HF8S" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_HF8S" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_HF8S" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_HF8S"
		"gather the receiving report" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_HF8S"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_HF8S" -> "schedule the payment"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"schedule the payment" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the vendor accounting department. 
When sending to the vendor accounting department is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a receiving report, the next tasks should be reporting errors to relevant team member and gathering the receiving report, they should be done in parallel. 
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then scheduling the payment should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
